# Shell and PBS scripts run under bash, locally and on Gadi, and must keep LF line
# endings in every checkout, Windows included. A CRLF copy fails at its first line
# ("set: pipefail: invalid option name"), and a CRLF commit would break the job on
# Gadi (ISS-15).
*.sh text eol=lf
*.pbs text eol=lf
